<document xmlns="http://cnx.rice.edu/cnxml" xmlns:m="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML">
  <title>6.5.6: Practice</title>
  <metadata xmlns:md="http://cnx.rice.edu/mdml">
    <md:content-id>m01669</md:content-id>
    <md:title>6.5.6: Practice</md:title>
    <md:uuid>b934f4e7-e4af-4f83-8345-706bcd3aeac5</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
  <section><para>Complete the following questions to practice the skills you have learned in this lesson.</para>
<section><exercise id="_0bdb1b35-0352-4b50-bb3f-19b160395d83" class="multiple-choice"><problem><para>For questions 1 – 3, factor.</para><para>\(u^2 − 9u + 18\)</para>
      <para>Multiple Choice:</para><para>\((u + 9)(u + 2)\)</para><para>\((u − 3)(u − 6)\)</para><para>\((u + 3)(u + 6)\)</para><para>\((u + 3)(u − 6)\)</para></problem><solution><para>Try again. Revisit 6.5.2.
    </para><para>The correct answer is \((u − 3)(u − 6)\).
    </para></solution></exercise><exercise id="_71bf43fc-e7e4-4f9f-b810-a5a0eea0a818" class="multiple-choice"><problem><para>\(8 − 6x + x^2\)</para>
      <para>Multiple Choice:</para><para>\((x + 4)(x + 2)\)</para><para>\((x − 8)(x + 1)\)</para><para>\((x − 4)(x − 2)\)</para><para>\((x + 4)(x − 2)\)</para></problem><solution><para>Try again. Revisit 6.5.2.</para><para>The correct answer is \((x - 4)(x - 2)\). You seem to be struggling. Who can you ask for help?</para></solution></exercise><exercise id="_6c119771-bb68-4913-814a-cf496992cf5e" class="multiple-choice"><problem><para>\(a^2 + 5ab − 24b^2\)</para>
      <para>Multiple Choice:</para><para>\((a − 8b)(a + 3b)\)</para><para>\((a − 8b)(a − 3b)\)</para><para>\((a + 8b)(a + 3b)\)</para><para>\((a + 8b)(a − 3b)\)</para></problem><solution><para>Try again. Revisit 6.5.2.</para><para>The correct answer is \((a + 8b)(a − 3b)\).
    </para></solution></exercise><exercise id="_72e0e494-14b6-4482-8d91-0fb4ba93310f" class="multiple-choice"><problem><para>For questions 4 – 5, factor using the trial and error method.</para><para>\( 4b^2 + 5b + 1\)</para>
      <para>Multiple Choice:</para><para>\((b − 1)(4b − 1)\)</para><para>\((5b + 1)(b − 1)\)</para><para>\((5b + 1)(b + 1)\)</para><para>\((b + 1)(4b + 1)\)</para></problem><solution><para>Try again. Revisit 6.5.4.</para><para>The correct answer is \((b + 1)(4b + 1)\). You seem to be struggling. Who can you ask for help?</para></solution></exercise><exercise id="e338f769-c779-431c-add0-81dfafd9da0b" class="multiple-choice"><problem><para>\(30x^2 − 53xy − 21y^2\)</para>
      <para>Multiple Choice:</para><para>\((3x + y)(10x − 21y)\)</para><para>\((15x + y)(2x − 21y)\)</para><para>\((5x + y)(6x − 21y)\)</para><para>\((3x − y)(10x − 21y)\)</para></problem><solution><para>Try again. Revisit 6.5.3.
    </para><para>The correct answer is \((3x + y)(10x − 21y)\).
    </para></solution></exercise><exercise id="_168e35c3-a6a1-4ad8-9956-e3a6f8072c1d" class="multiple-choice"><problem><para>Factor completely using the “\(ac\)” method: \(4y^2 + 8y + 3\).</para>
      <para>Multiple Choice:</para><para>\((2y − 1)(2y − 3)\)</para><para>\((2y + 1)(2y + 3)\)</para><para>\((2y − 1)(2y + 3)\)</para><para>\((2y + 1)(2y − 3)\)</para></problem><solution><para>Try again. Revisit 6.5.4.
    </para><para>The correct answer is \((2y + 1)(2y + 3)\).
    </para></solution></exercise><exercise id="_9db4f6e2-ca63-485a-8b53-73856f64b8bd" class="multiple-choice"><problem><para>Factor completely using the “\(ac\)” method: \(18w^2 − 39w + 18\).</para>
      <para>Multiple Choice:</para><para>\((9w − 2)(2w − 3)\)</para><para>\( 3(3w − 2)(2w − 3)\)</para><para>\(3(3w + 2)(2w + 3)\)</para><para>\(3(3w + 2)(2w − 3)\)</para></problem><solution><para>Try again. Revisit 6.5.4.
    </para><para>The correct answer is \(3(3w − 2)(2w − 3)\).
    </para></solution></exercise><exercise id="_156c246d-2c71-40e2-b461-8203f16fa9f9" class="multiple-choice"><problem><para>Factor by substitution: \(h^4 + 4h^2 − 12\).</para>
      <para>Multiple Choice:</para><para>\((h^2 + 2)(h^2 − 6)\)</para><para>\((h + 2)(h − 6)\)</para><para>\((h − 2)(h + 6)\)</para><para>\((h^2 − 2)(h^2 + 6)\)</para></problem><solution><para>Try again. Revisit 6.5.4.
    </para><para>The correct answer is \((h^2 − 2)(h^2 + 6)\).
    </para></solution></exercise><exercise id="ff4ec407-60de-4cab-a76e-1df51a67d56c" class="multiple-choice"><problem><para>Factor by substitution: \((y − 4)^2 + 8(y − 4) + 15\).</para>
      <para>Multiple Choice:</para><para>\((y + 1)^2\)</para><para>\((y + 5)(y + 3)\)</para>
      <para>\((y − 1)(y + 1)\)</para><para>\((y − 5)(y − 3)\)</para></problem><solution><para>Try again. Revisit 6.5.4.
    </para><para>The correct answer is \((y − 1)(y + 1)\).</para></solution></exercise>
     <exercise id="bedcdf71-41c4-449a-8be9-5614b3fb34e1" class="multiple-choice"><problem><para>Factor using any method: \(13z^2 + 39z − 26\).</para>
      <para>Multiple Choice:</para><para>\(13(2z + 1)(z + 2)\)</para><para>\(13(2z − 1)(z + 2)\)</para><para>\(13(2z + 1)(z − 2)\)</para><para>\(13(z^2 + 3z - 2)\)</para></problem><solution><para>Try again. Revisit 6.5.5.
    </para><para>The correct answer is \(13(z^2 + 3z - 2)\).
    </para></solution></exercise></section></section>
</content>
